    "created_at": "2019-02-13T18:37:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-02-13T18:37:22Z",
    "body": "One benefit of just having a filename on Response vs synthesizing a Content-Disposition header, by the way, is that if your filename is non-ASCII then putting it into a Content-Disposition header is a bit of rocket science, and getting it _out_ of there is even more rocket science...",
